{"title":"Turntable","slug":"Turntable","hero":null,"pageid":1254,"revid":12947,"timestamp":"2024-05-24T20:41:01Z","lastEditor":"ItsKairoKay","categories":["Structures"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Ferwater"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Illumine Desings"},{"label":"Price","value":"$725"},{"label":"Function","value":"Spin"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.26.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"07/17/2023"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"}],"body":"<p><i><big>\"A spinning plane that can be used to display your objects!\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n\n<p>The Turntable is found in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Illumine_Designs/\">Illumine Designs</a> and can be bought for $725.\n</p><p>\nIt spins and makes items and players on it spin too.</p><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: A loop of the turntable rotating an item\">A loop of the turntable rotating an item</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>A loop of the turntable rotating an item</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><h3 id=\"automation\">Automation</h3>\n<p>Normally Items that stay still for a certain amount of time eventually anchor thus no longer being affected by gravity, for loading items into crates this causes items that aren't <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Snow_Tree/\">slippery</a> to stack and get the crate stuck, the Turntable effectively reduces the chance of this happening by constantly moving the crates and its contents leading to new items falling into different areas of said crate.\n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: A Turntable being used to load Planks into a\">A Turntable being used to load Planks into a</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: A Turntable being used to load Planks into a\">A Turntable being used to load Planks into a</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>A Turntable being used to load Planks into a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Large_Crate/\">Large Crate</a></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>"}
